          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="An increased perception that a rival (or adversarial) actor effectively controls the strait provokes executives to issue more frequent and forceful directives (rules-of-engagement changes, authorizations for operations) to reassert policy and military objectives." />
