          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="If perceptions shift toward stronger Iranian control of the strait, Israeli planners are likely to ratchet up offensive or preemptive operations against Lebanese fronts to signal deterrence and complicate Iran's ability to translate maritime control into wider leverage." />
