          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A sustained rise in hostile incidents in the Strait provides political cover and evidentiary pretexts for the US to broaden export controls and sanctions on firms (including Chinese intermediaries) accused of enabling Iranian maritime or military activity." />
