          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.62" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Sharper U.S. export controls provoke Beijing and Moscow to escalate public diplomacy and mediatory engagement with Lebanon, Iran and UN fora as a counterweight to U.S. policy, increasing external diplomatic interventions around the Israel–Lebanon front." />
